+
+**Formulas:**
+
+The expected color $\hat{C}(r)$ of a camera ray $r(t) = o + td$ is computed via volume rendering:
 $$
 \hat{C}(r) = \sum_{i=1}^{N} T(t_i)(1 - \exp(-\sigma(t_i)\delta_i))c(t_i)
 $$
